        q("r10",YdsTopic.Paragraph,YdsDifficulty.Easy,"Passage: 'Amina visits the library every Tuesday. She borrows two books and returns them the next week.' What does she do every Tuesday?","She borrows books.","She buys furniture.","She closes the library.","She works in a hospital.","Metinde her salı iki kitap ödünç aldığı açıkça belirtilir."),
